Package: GateLabR
Title: Interactive Manual Gating for SingleCellExperiment Objects
Version: 1.3.0
Authors@R:
    person("David", "Priest", email = "david.priest898@gmail.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0003-0095-6718"))
Description: A desktop-style Shiny application for interactive manual gating of
    flow cytometry and mass cytometry (CyTOF) data directly on
    SingleCellExperiment objects. Supports polygon, rectangle and quadrant
    gates, boolean population hierarchies, per-channel logicle / arcsinh
    transforms, embedded-spillover compensation, GatingML 2.0 import and export,
    FCS export, publication-style figure export, a cell-division (CFSE /
    CellTrace dye-dilution) profiler that writes per-cell Div0..DivN calls back to
    the object, and a colData composition-preview tab (stacked-bar and boxplot
    proportions). Gates, populations and settings persist inside the object's
    metadata.
